"PartCAD has no implicit dependencies built-in, so a dependency on the "
"public PartCAD repository needs to be added if PartCAD is supposed to "
"query it."
msgstr ""
"PartCAD no tiene dependencias implícitas integradas, por lo que se debe "
"agregar una dependencia del repositorio público de PartCAD si se espera "
"que PartCAD lo consulte."

